.Dd May 13, 2026
.Dt ANVIL 1
.Os

.Sh NAME
.Nm anvil
.Nd reference build system specification for invil/amboso

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Op Ar tag
.Op Ar extra_args ...
.Op Ar command

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a tag-driven build system specification implemented by two compatible
frontends:

.Bl -tag -width "invil"
.It Sy amboso
POSIX shell reference implementation.
.It Sy invil
Rust canonical implementation.
.El

.Pp
.Nm
orchestrates builds, tests, and project initialization on top of
.Xr make 1 ,
.Xr git 1 ,
and optional build kernels.

.Pp
A build is defined by:

.Bl -tag -width "kern"
.It Sy tag
Optional identifier for a build configuration.
.It Sy mode
Execution mode.
Supported modes include:
.Sy base ,
.Sy git ,
.Sy test ,
and
.Sy testmacro .
.It Sy kern
Build backend selector.
Supported kernels include:
.Sy anvilC ,
.Sy anvilPy ,
and
.Sy custom .
.El

.Pp
If
.Ar tag
is omitted, the latest available tag is selected using
implementation-defined ordering.

.Sh OPTIONS

.Ss Core directories

.Bl -tag -width "--stego-dir"

.It Fl D Ar dir , Fl -amboso-dir Ns = Ns Ar dir
Directory for tag artifacts.
Default:
.Pa ./bin

.It Fl O Ar dir , Fl -stego-dir Ns = Ns Ar dir
Directory containing
.Pa stego.lock .
Default: current directory.

.It Fl I Ar dir , Fl -builds-dir Ns = Ns Ar dir
Build output directory.
Default: current directory.

.It Fl K Ar dir , Fl -kazoj-dir Ns = Ns Ar dir
Test directory root.
.El

.Ss Build configuration

.Bl -tag -width "--execname"

.It Fl S Ar name , Fl -source Ns = Ns Ar name
Set source name.

.It Fl E Ar name , Fl -execname Ns = Ns Ar name
Set output executable name.

.It Fl M Ar tag , Fl -maketag Ns = Ns Ar tag
Minimum tag requiring make-based build.
.El

.Ss Versioning

.Bl -tag -width "--anvil-version"

.It Fl a Ar version , Fl -anvil-version Ns = Ns Ar version
Set compatibility version.
Default:
.Sy 2.1.2

.It Fl k Ar kern , Fl -anvil-kern Ns = Ns Ar kern
Set build kernel.
Default:
.Sy amboso-C
.El

.Ss Code generation

.Bl -tag -width "--gen-c-header"

.It Fl G Ar dir , Fl -gen-c-header Ns = Ns Ar dir
Generate C header with build metadata and system information.
.El

.Ss Modes

.Bl -tag -width "--testmacro"

.It Fl T , Fl -test
Enable test mode.

.It Fl B , Fl -base
Enable base mode.

.It Fl g , Fl -git
Enable git mode.

.It Fl t , Fl -testmacro
Enable test macro mode.
.El

.Ss Actions

.Bl -tag -width "--list-all"

.It Fl i , Fl -init
Initialize or build all tags for current mode.

.It Fl p , Fl -purge
Remove all build artifacts for current mode.

.It Fl d , Fl -delete
Delete artifact for specified tag.

.It Fl b , Fl -build
Build specified tag.

.It Fl r , Fl -run
Run built artifact for specified tag.

.It Fl l , Fl -list
List tags for current mode.

.It Fl L , Fl -list-all
List tags for all modes.
.El

.Ss Output control

.Bl -tag -width "--verbose"

.It Fl q , Fl -quiet
Reduce output verbosity.

.It Fl s , Fl -silent
Suppress most output.

.It Fl V Ar level , Fl -verbose Ns = Ns Ar level
Set verbosity level.
Default:
.Sy 3

.It Fl w , Fl -watch
Report execution timing.

.It Fl J , Fl -logged
Write output to
.Pa anvil.log .

.It Fl P , Fl -no-color
Disable colored output.
.El

.Ss Build control

.Bl -tag -width "--no-rebuild"

.It Fl F , Fl -force
Force rebuild.

.It Fl R , Fl -no-rebuild
Disable automatic
.Sy make rebuild
step.

.It Fl C Ar arg , Fl -config Ns = Ns Ar arg
Pass configuration argument to build system.

.It Fl Z Ar flags , Fl -cflags Ns = Ns Ar flags
Pass compiler flags for single-file builds.
.El

.Ss Compatibility

.Bl -tag -width "--ignore-gitcheck"

.It Fl e , Fl -strict
Disable extensions beyond amboso 2.0 semantics.

.It Fl X , Fl -ignore-gitcheck
Ignore git mode validation.
.El

.Ss Miscellaneous

.Bl -tag -width "--warranty"

.It Fl v , Fl -version
Print version and exit.

.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print help and exit.

.It Fl W , Fl -warranty
Print warranty information.

.It Fl Y Ar time
Set explicit start timestamp.

.It Fl z
Run
.Sy make pack
target.
.El

.Sh COMMANDS

.Bl -tag -width "version"

.It Sy test Op Ar testname
Run all tests or a specific test.

.It Sy build
Build latest or selected tag.

.It Sy init
Initialize a new project.

.It Sy version
Print version information.
.El

.Sh BEHAVIOR

.Bl -tag -width "Strict mode"

.It Sy Rebuild policy
Build invokes
.Sy "make rebuild"
by default unless disabled with
.Fl -no-rebuild .

.It Sy Logging
When
.Fl -logged
is enabled, output is written to
.Pa anvil.log .

.It Sy Strict mode
When
.Fl -strict
is enabled, extensions beyond amboso 2.0 semantics are disabled.

.It Sy Config precedence
Command-line options override configuration file values.
.El

.Sh FILES

.Bl -tag -width "stego.lock"

.It Pa ./bin/
Default directory for build artifacts.

.It Pa stego.lock
Project configuration file.

.It Pa anvil.log
Log output file.
.El

.Sh COMPATIBILITY

.Bl -tag -width "amboso"

.It Sy amboso
Reference shell implementation defining baseline behavior.

.It Sy invil
Canonical Rust implementation defining extended behavior.
.El

.Pp
Divergence between implementations is permitted only when explicitly
specified in this specification.

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr anvil.conf 5 ,
.Xr make 1 ,
.Xr git 1
